; Dogfooding v1: LOOM decides whether one local candidate has all three
; operator-supplied facts required by our development discipline.
;
; The role quorum is checker-enforced. The input facts are deliberately not
; called verified: an external evidence adapter must establish them later.

(defx main () (fn (evidence_quorum)
  (if (= evidence_quorum 3)
    (trust (roles code spec proof)
      (by code developer
        (by spec operator
          (by proof citadel 1))))
    0)))
